{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"focusGuideX"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"focusGuideY"},{"type":"text","value":" render ordinary scene nodes only for the active\nfocus target. Import them from the exact optional subpath:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For an unsnapped x/y value pair with no datum focus target, use\n"},{"type":"link","href":"../focus-and-interaction.md#continuous-cursor","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"continuousCursor"}]},{"type":"text","value":" instead."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { focusGuideX } from '@tanstack/charts/focus/guide'\n\nfocusGuideX(rows, {\n  id: 'cursor',\n  x: 'period',\n  y: 'value',\n  z: 'series',\n  key: 'id',\n  yRule: {},\n  marker: {},\n  xLabel: { format: (period) => period },\n  yLabel: { format: (value) => String(value) },\n  motion: {\n    transition: { type: 'spring', stiffness: 240, damping: 22 },\n  },\n})","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"focusGuideX"},{"type":"text","value":" enables the vertical x rule by default. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"focusGuideY"},{"type":"text","value":" enables the\nhorizontal y rule. Configure both rules on either mark for a crosshair."}]},{"type":"code","value":"function focusGuideX<TDatum>(\n  source: Iterable<TDatum>,\n  options: FocusGuideOptions<TDatum>,\n): ChartMark<TDatum>\n\nfunction focusGuideY<TDatum>(\n  source: Iterable<TDatum>,\n  options: FocusGuideOptions<TDatum>,\n): ChartMark<TDatum>","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Default"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type"